# QA-172 Failure Report

## Failed Criterion
**AC #2 & BDD Step #2-3**: Compact View option availability at firm level via HDASH > Firms > Edit

## Root Cause
The test cannot locate the "Firms" text element on the HDASH page. The page likely loaded but the navigation menu/content either:
- Did not render in time (timing issue)
- Uses different text/selector than expected
- Requires additional navigation steps before "Firms" is clickable

The 30-second timeout on `getByText('Firms').click()` indicates the element never appeared.

## Recommended Fix
**Replace generic text selector with available selector or add explicit wait:**

```typescript
// Option 1: Use sidebar navigation if available
await page.locator('selector:has-text("Firms")').waitFor({ state: 'visible', timeout: 10000 });
await page.getByText('Firms').click();

// Option 2: Add page load verification before navigation
await page.waitForLoadState('networkidle');
await page.getByText('Firms').click();

// Option 3: Check if sidebar needs to be opened first
await page.locator('[data-testid="sidebar-panel"]').click();
await page.getByText('Firms').click();
```

## Next Steps
- Review HDASH page structure in browser DevTools
- Confirm "Firms" link location and visibility state
- Add explicit waits for page stability before navigation attempts
